# 👹 AETHERIA — BOSS RAID SYSTEM

> **A Boss is a challenge.**
>
> **A Raid Boss is a world event.**
>
> A Raid Boss is not designed to be defeated by a single Hero or a single Party.
>
> It is a large-scale threat that requires preparation, multiple Parties, strategic management, and cooperation between Heroes.

---

# 1. SYSTEM OVERVIEW

**Boss Raid System** adalah salah satu fitur utama dari:

```text
DUNGEON SYSTEM
```

Boss Raid digunakan untuk menghadapi musuh dengan kekuatan jauh di atas Boss Dungeon biasa.

Struktur:

```text
DUNGEON SYSTEM
│
├── Floor Progression
│
├── Combat Dungeon
│
├── World Exploration
│
├── Boss Dungeon
│
└── BOSS RAID SYSTEM
```

Boss Raid dapat menjadi tantangan khusus yang muncul berdasarkan:

```text
Floor
Game State
Event
Quest
Destruction Level
RNG
Story Progression
```

---

# 2. BOSS RAID CONCEPT

Raid Boss adalah Boss yang memiliki:

```text
Extremely High HP
Multiple Phases
Unique Mechanics
Special Skills
Environmental Effects
Multiple Targets
Raid Objectives
Special Rewards
```

Raid Boss tidak harus selalu muncul di setiap Floor.

Kemunculannya dikontrol oleh:

```text
GAME STATE SYSTEM
+
EVENT SYSTEM
+
RNG SYSTEM
```

