# 4. RAID PARTY

Boss Raid dapat menggunakan beberapa Party.

Party mengikuti:

```text
PARTY SYSTEM
```

Setiap Party maksimal:

```text
5 HEROES
```

Contoh:

```text
RAID TEAM

Party 1
├── Hero A
├── Hero B
├── Hero C
├── Hero D
└── Hero E

Party 2
├── Hero F
├── Hero G
├── Hero H
├── Hero I
└── Hero J

Party 3
├── Hero K
├── Hero L
├── Hero M
├── Hero N
└── Hero O
```

Jumlah Party yang dapat digunakan tergantung pada:

```text
Master Progression
Dungeon Unlock
Raid Requirement
Game State
```

