# 51. FINAL CONCEPT

Boss Raid membuat Tower memiliki tantangan berskala besar.

```text
DUNGEON
   │
   ├── NORMAL COMBAT
   │
   ├── WORLD EXPLORATION
   │
   ├── BOSS
   │
   └── RAID BOSS
            │
            ▼
      MULTIPLE PARTIES
            │
            ▼
        HERO AI
            │
            ▼
        BOSS AI
            │
            ▼
      RAID MECHANICS
            │
            ▼
       RAID VICTORY
            │
            ▼
          RNG
            │
            ▼
          LOOT
            │
            ▼
       INVENTORY
            │
            ▼
      GAME STATE
            │
            ▼
        DATABASE
```

> **A normal Boss tests a Party.**
>
> **A Raid Boss tests the Master.**
>
> **Because when a threat becomes powerful enough, five Heroes are no longer enough.**
>
> **The Master must decide who will fight, who will lead, who will support, and who will survive.**
